t previews are byte-exact. Three claimed mutants are caught; the production raw-flag mutant escapes. The proposal regression and lost-reply controls above ran in isolated test workrooms. I did not independently rerun the whole repository suite or perform live GitHub, resident renewal, key/custody or deployment operations.\n\nKeep corrections on the live implementation commitment, cite these findings in the corrected exact-head artifacts, and request fresh independent review after publishing the complete revised head. This verdict does not authorize a merge.\n\nEvidence: git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:7801d78c9d851dd6f2419fd8f3dd5a6d62f87a52\nI also read Planner's independently matching production-wiring finding git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:9e7cca3fae1a3b93cfea95bff0fda8be8ec1f973; it reports the same raw-flag omission escaping the entire connector package, while my evidence covers the named routing matrix.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:d6c0aa7f9b2a271210a3662da8878362349e2420","binding":"assigned","head":"5a0fbc38fe2295cd309af7f2d41323362a034b15","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:1988b5a6e61ab15720a7630a31175bebd87e5b07\",\"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:9e7cca3fae1a3b93cfea95bff0fda8be8ec1f973\",\"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:7801d78c9d851dd6f2419fd8f3dd5a6d62f87a52\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:464731c75090708962aae0a28869c8604d42649e\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:ba72b3f551f602d6f84aa434b06f6633e7dd37f2","review_path":"reviewguard@1","stale":"true","stale_bases":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:0d0c8bb400d2cc9f6cfb6236861b34b92b9b4150, git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:1988b5a6e61ab15720a763